Yeah I am home and uh it's good to be here

00:00:47.900 --> 00:00:50.100
It's good to be around my family again

00:00:50.140 --> 00:00:52.540
It's good to see my friends again and

00:00:53.040 --> 00:00:55.680
It always just feels calmer here than LA

00:00:56.040 --> 00:00:59.900
mostly because it is, traffic is less, there's less people and generally

00:01:01.500 --> 00:01:03.020
it's just a bit more easy going

00:01:03.600 --> 00:01:06.660
and it always feels grounding to be around my friends

00:01:07.020 --> 00:01:09.580
and I was really happy to be able to do the charity live stream

00:01:09.580 --> 00:01:13.100
