00:01:13.100 --> 00:01:16.020
I know we were very close to our 150 thousand dollar goal.

00:01:17.540 --> 00:01:22.100
But moreover than that I just like being here because it reminds me of

00:01:22.220 --> 00:01:22.780
you know

00:01:22.780 --> 00:01:26.580
why I started all of this and why I decided to do this because

00:01:27.420 --> 00:01:28.420
I-I-I think...

00:01:29.720 --> 00:01:33.680
I think early on in my career on youtube, huh, my "career" on youtube

00:01:33.700 --> 00:01:36.840
I landed on the right attitude

00:01:37.940 --> 00:01:39.700
towards what I wanted to do with this channel

00:01:39.960 --> 00:01:41.820
it was to spread joy

00:01:42.780 --> 00:01:47.580
and bring happiness and do some good for the world around me and

00:01:49.580 --> 00:01:52.140
and I look back four and a half years ago

00:01:52.940 --> 00:01:55.260
when I first started in this very house

00:01:56.520 --> 00:02:00.600
and I just see the progress that we've made since that time

00:02:01.180 --> 00:02:04.660
and I look back and I remember all the different things we've done

00:02:05.020 --> 00:02:09.360
all the different challenges that we have faced and I say we as in you and me

00:02:09.360 --> 00:02:11.520
I'm not talking about me and my friends

00:02:11.520 --> 00:02:13.700
we've faced challenged ourselves but like

00:02:13.840 --> 00:02:14.940
you and I

00:02:15.420 --> 00:02:19.360
we have come a long, long way

00:02:20.660 --> 00:02:24.580
and some of you may have not been here this whole time and that's totally fine

00:02:24.860 --> 00:02:28.260
I know there's so many of you out there and it's hard to imagine

00:02:28.740 --> 00:02:30.260
the sheer magnitude of

00:02:30.960 --> 00:02:35.620
living everyday of your life with more and more people walking through the door.

00:02:37.720 --> 00:02:44.900
But I remember back here, back when I first started and I could communicate with every single subscriber individually

00:02:45.720 --> 00:02:49.160
and the wonder of that time, it was a beautiful thing.

00:02:50.700 --> 00:02:55.620
And not saying it's turned into an ugly thing, if anything it's even more beautiful than it was before because

00:02:56.400 --> 00:03:03.860
the charity live stream that we did yesterday is an indication of that very same spirit that we started the channel with

00:03:04.420 --> 00:03:04.920
(bubble screeches)

00:03:05.400 --> 00:03:05.900
Hey

00:03:06.480 --> 00:03:07.040
none of that

00:03:07.220 --> 00:03:07.720
Bubble

00:03:08.280 --> 00:03:09.400
I know you want up

00:03:09.860 --> 00:03:11.060
but it's Maggie's turn

00:03:11.880 --> 00:03:12.380
okay?

00:03:12.440 --> 00:03:12.940
(Bubble whines)

00:03:13.120 --> 00:03:13.620
aaah

00:03:14.000 --> 00:03:14.980
don't whine

00:03:15.820 --> 00:03:16.440
nu-nu-nu-nu-no

00:03:16.440 --> 00:03:16.940
(Bubble sneezes)

00:03:16.980 --> 00:03:18.080
a-snuff, bless you

00:03:18.080 --> 00:03:26.360
anyway that same spirit that I started the channel with and the idea that we were going to spread joy and we were gonna do good and we

00:03:26.360 --> 00:03:26.860
(Bubble barks)

00:03:27.000 --> 00:03:28.800
I'm trying to talk here!

00:03:29.040 --> 00:03:30.840
I'm trying to talk none of that, wrong!

00:03:31.280 --> 00:03:32.140
I'll boop you on the nose!

00:03:32.180 --> 00:03:33.860
oh-jeez welp here's lucy

00:03:34.280 --> 00:03:35.200
Hi lucy!

00:03:35.520 --> 00:03:36.800
welcome to party

00:03:37.460 --> 00:03:40.640
I was in the middle of something and then you all interrupt

00:03:40.700 --> 00:03:42.360
now sit and stay still!

00:03:43.260 --> 00:03:44.080
Sit still!

00:03:44.080 --> 00:03:48.600
Good girl Lucy, I know you can't sit in my lap cause you're too huge,

00:03:49.200 --> 00:03:51.300
but I will play with you after the video's done okay?

00:03:51.300 --> 00:03:54.640
It's fascinating to see that same spirit burning

00:03:55.380 --> 00:04:01.700
and it's not just my heart and the hearts of my friends whom have been inspired to do things

00:04:01.700 --> 00:04:08.160
and it's even weird to think that I inspired my friends to do good but Bob told me as much

00:04:08.680 --> 00:04:14.200
during the live stream yesterday and it really... those words really resonated with me.

00:04:15.760 --> 00:04:21.680
Like knowing that I introduced this concept of... not that I started this concept, not by anyone

00:04:21.680 --> 00:04:27.840
but I introduced this concept that what I do here on youtube and playing games and having fun with

00:04:27.940 --> 00:04:30.080
with friends and family and you guys

00:04:31.440 --> 00:04:34.060
could lead to good in the world.

00:04:34.920 --> 00:04:41.920
That's an amazing feeling and I always get in a mood of self-reflection when I come back here

00:04:42.600 --> 00:04:44.920
and I know it's easy to get lost in the...

00:04:45.540 --> 00:04:50.560
the dismay of like this year, 2016 has been quite a year

00:04:51.160 --> 00:04:55.260
and I know it's easy to get lost in the general pessimism

00:04:56.720 --> 00:05:01.480
of what seems to go on, because in this day n' age everything is about sharing

00:05:01.840 --> 00:05:06.560
but I think sometimes people forget that it's so important to share the right things

00:05:06.840 --> 00:05:09.300
and it's so important to share the right message

00:05:09.300 --> 00:05:14.160
because as a species we're programmed to look at disaster and be like "oh! that is fascinating!"

00:05:14.160 --> 00:05:17.440
but we gotta remember that we look at that as a warning so that we don't

00:05:18.320 --> 00:05:22.160
allow that to control our lives and when that's all we hear

00:05:22.800 --> 00:05:25.860
even on the internet or in our daily lives and that becomes

00:05:26.320 --> 00:05:33.280
like the chorus of our entire existence. Like the theme song of our life becomes this depressing parade

00:05:33.720 --> 00:05:37.960
and that's not what I ever want to do

00:05:39.040 --> 00:05:42.540
I only ever want to bring joy and I always feel

00:05:43.600 --> 00:05:47.780
more connected with that when I am with my family and with my friends

00:05:47.780 --> 00:05:54.200
I am doing things that I am so proud of doing and I'm making videos that make me laugh as much as they make you laugh

00:05:54.500 --> 00:05:55.000
and

00:05:55.960 --> 00:05:59.820
I just wanted to say that I am very, very happy

00:06:00.840 --> 00:06:03.340
with where I am and with who I am

00:06:03.940 --> 00:06:06.100
and even though I'm 27 years old

00:06:06.440 --> 00:06:07.720
I'm not done growing up

00:06:10.420 --> 00:06:12.740
I've come a long, long way

00:06:13.360 --> 00:06:15.980
from the person I was when started this channel

00:06:16.720 --> 00:06:17.220
and

00:06:17.580 --> 00:06:24.580
I've hit road blocks and I've hit obstacles and I've hit challenges and I have overcome them and some I have not overcome...

00:06:24.880 --> 00:06:25.380
yet

00:06:27.240 --> 00:06:28.640
but I am so happy with

00:06:30.080 --> 00:06:33.700
the fact that I have been able to stay true to this course that we

00:06:34.240 --> 00:06:34.980
you and I

00:06:35.500 --> 00:06:39.440
are able to stay true to what we do here on this channel

00:06:39.700 --> 00:06:41.060
which is at it's core

00:06:41.060 --> 00:06:47.420
to spread joy and happiness to everyone that needs it and that is why I am happy to be home

00:06:48.480 --> 00:06:53.600
and while I'm here, I plan to do some videos with my mother

00:06:53.920 --> 00:06:59.160
who you guys have only seen briefly in pictures and in small snippets of videos but

00:06:59.880 --> 00:07:04.680
I have an idea, she has been learning to do VERY, VERY good nail decoration

00:07:05.280 --> 00:07:11.560
so I think I'm gonna have her do my nails because she needs to practice and I need to get my nails done because they're horrid

00:07:11.560 --> 00:07:15.100
and I think I'm going to have her try to play a game

00:07:15.600 --> 00:07:22.040
and I think I know exactly the game she needs to play, I believe I am going to try to get my mom to play Five Nights at Freddy's

00:07:22.380 --> 00:07:26.100
and she is not gonna know what the hell to do but my mom

00:07:26.600 --> 00:07:36.720
is the most unintentionally hilarious person I know, I could start a book series on texts from my mom, texts from my mom

00:07:37.200 --> 00:07:45.100
she is THE funniest texter on the face of the earth and if you guys wanna see some of those let me know down in the comments

00:07:45.100 --> 00:07:52.560
if you wanna see a specific game for us to play let us know down in the comments and expect the nail painting video very soon

00:07:53.060 --> 00:07:59.980
but for now I'm gonna celebrate Christmas with my doggies and celebrate Christmas with my family

00:08:00.540 --> 00:08:07.300
and I'm gonna spend a good while kinda relaxing while at the same time getting videos to you guys because

00:08:07.300 --> 00:08:11.920
the thing I plan to do while I am here is play nothing but indie horror games because

00:08:11.920 --> 00:08:17.380
I have been stock piling lists of them and saving it just for this occasion when I am back home

00:08:17.380 --> 00:08:21.340
in my old recording room and in my old recording set up and

00:08:21.340 --> 00:08:24.480
able to make videos for you guys so that should be a lot of fun

00:08:25.400 --> 00:08:31.940
but at the end of it all just thank you guys so much for being here with me on this amazing journey

00:08:31.940 --> 00:08:33.760
that is not yet over

00:08:34.900 --> 00:08:41.380
and I have no idea when it's gonna end but hopefully the spirit of what we do here always carries on

00:08:42.220 --> 00:08:44.540
So thank you everybody so much for watching!

00:08:44.540 --> 00:08:47.640
thank you Bubble for being a rambunctious little stinker!

00:08:47.640 --> 00:08:49.840
Thank you Maggie for being such a good girl!

00:08:50.460 --> 00:08:52.900
and thank you everybody again for watching.

00:08:53.300 --> 00:08:56.000
And as always I will see you

00:08:56.520 --> 00:08:57.640
In the next video

